<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Trade was inactive in the panhandle area late Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested at the close.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. No sales confirmed following weekly movement of 41,200 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed:  None    Week Ago:  92,100    Year Ago:  1,800</p>
